  "duration_s": 417.726984,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九四九年十月一号下午三点，天安门广场上锣鼓喧天，礼炮轰鸣，全中国都沉浸在胜利的欢呼声中。几公里外的协和医院产房里，一位产妇拉着医生的手，小心翼翼的问，林大夫，外面这么热闹，您不去看看吗？医生笑着摇摇头，说出一句，让在场所有人都记了一辈子的话，不去了，就民族的未来都在你们肚子里了。这位医生就是林巧智。那天，他其实收到了一张红底金字的请柬，开国大典观礼邀请函。可他把他搁在桌上，转身进了产房。在他心里，产房里每一声啼哭都比天安门城楼上的万道荣光更重要。有人不理解，他说是不是不爱这个国家。您要是知道他这一辈子做过什么，就不会这么问了。一九三九年，他在美国芝加哥进修美国顶级医院开出优厚条件留他他说科学可以没有国界，医生不能没有祖国回国。一九四九年解放前夕，傅作义将军的夫人亲自送来一张亲笔签名的飞机票，拿着他能去任何城市，多少人用金条都换不来，他却谢绝了。我的病人还在这儿，我哪儿也不去，他不是不爱国，他只是把国守在了产房里，他爱这个国家的证据是一点一点做出来的。一九零一年，他出生在厦门鼓浪屿，五岁丧母励志学医，一九二一年考进协和医学院，后来成了新中国。第一位女院士，中国妇产科学的奠基人，他接生了五万多个婴儿，其中就有袁隆平钟南山见了他都要喊一声姑婆，可您知道吗？他做的还不止这些，他发现光在产房里救人远远不够。新中国成立前，我国的婴儿死亡率高达千分之二百。什么意思？每出生一千个孩子有两百个活不过周岁，多少孩子根本等不到见医生一面。他说过一句特别朴素的话，医院只是治病的第二道防线。第一道防线是在预防上。于是他带着团队在北京开展大规模的妇女宫颈癌普查。那时候很多农村妇女一辈子没进过医院，觉得妇科检查不光彩，躲着不去，他就挨家挨户的动员，带着医生们上门。在他苦口婆心的劝解之下，几十万名女性走进医院，他了人生第一次妇科检查，他怕老百姓听不懂。医学术语就主编了家庭卫生顾问、农村妇幼卫生常识问答，用大白话告诉最偏远的山村妇女生孩子不是闯鬼门关，他接生一般不开刀，而是努力矫正胎位。他说，绝不能出现医生治好了病，病人却失去了完整生活的情况。他守产房一守就是半个多世纪。一九四一年，太平洋战争爆发，协和医院关门。他就在东堂子胡同开小诊所，穷人没钱治病，嗯，还倒贴鸡蛋和红糖。后来那些年，他受了委屈，被伐打扫卫生，洗便盆，他也只说一句，只要还让我留在协和，干什么都行。一九八三年四月二十二号，八十二岁的他走了，弥留之际，他断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来，这是他留在世间的最后一句话。林巧志生前留下遗嘱三万元积蓄，全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究。骨灰撒回故乡鼓浪屿的海面。您看他这一辈子，其实就干了一件事儿，让中国的孩子平安的来到这个世界上开国大典那天，他没能站在天安门城楼上。可今天。每一个平安出生的中国孩子，每一个当了妈妈的中国女人都记得他，什么叫爱国？爱国不是喊口号，是把民族的未来。一个个接到人世间民族的未来是谁？就是咱们的孩子。可孩子总会长大，总有一天会问爷爷，咱们中国为什么了不起？到那时候，您指着手里的国之脊梁跟他说，因为中我出过这样一群人，林巧至钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等等四十位院士，他们一辈子的故事。全在这本书里，中科院学不编的有老照片，有插画，孩子看得进去，大子看得心热。科学群星耀华夏院士精神代代传说的就是他们，您给孩子讲这些不是讲故事，是给他心心里种下一颗种子，这个国家是靠什么人撑起来的。等有一天孩子跟别人说起，我爷爷给我讲过林巧智，您就明白了什么是真正的爱国教育。这本书我不是非让我是觉得他该在攒家书架上，有一本不冲，别的就冲。孩子将来能挺直腰杆，说一句，咱中国出过这样的人，点亮红心收藏这条视频，转发给家里当妈的人，看看评论区留下一句致敬万英之母，让更多人记住这位把一生献给中国母亲和孩子的医生。关注我，下期讲述最后一个问题，如果人民币上要印一位中国女性，凭什么是她？",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 2970,
      "text": "一九四九年十月一号下午三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3750,
      "end_ms": 6070,
      "text": "天安门广场上锣鼓喧天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 7030,
      "text": "礼炮轰鸣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7410,
      "end_ms": 10550,
      "text": "全中国都沉浸在胜利的欢呼声中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11270,
      "end_ms": 13850,
      "text": "几公里外的协和医院产房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14350,
      "end_ms": 16770,
      "text": "一位产妇拉着医生的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17130,
      "end_ms": 18390,
      "text": "小心翼翼的问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18730,
      "end_ms": 19410,
      "text": "林大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19650,
      "end_ms": 20550,
      "text": "外面这么热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20550,
      "end_ms": 21930,
      "text": "您不去看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21930,
      "end_ms": 24090,
      "text": "医生笑着摇摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24090,
      "end_ms": 25330,
      "text": "说出一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25330,
      "end_ms": 28330,
      "text": "让在场所有人都记了一辈子的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28330,
      "end_ms": 29590,
      "text": "不去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29630,
      "end_ms": 33100,
      "text": "就民族的未来都在你们肚子里了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33580,
      "end_ms": 35740,
      "text": "这位医生就是林巧智。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35960,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36640,
      "end_ms": 40400,
      "text": "他其实收到了一张红底金字的请柬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41000,
      "end_ms": 43460,
      "text": "开国大典观礼邀请函。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44200,
      "end_ms": 45780,
      "text": "可他把他搁在桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46200,
      "end_ms": 47820,
      "text": "转身进了产房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48800,
      "end_ms": 49800,
      "text": "在他心里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 50300,
      "end_ms": 56980,
      "text": "产房里每一声啼哭都比天安门城楼上的万道荣光更重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57980,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "text": "有人不理解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59640,
      "end_ms": 61645,
      "text": "他说是不是不爱这个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 62160,
      "end_ms": 65080,
      "text": "您要是知道他这一辈子做过什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 65400,
      "end_ms": 66885,
      "text": "就不会这么问了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 67460,
      "end_ms": 68645,
      "text": "一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 69050,
      "end_ms": 77925,
      "text": "他在美国芝加哥进修美国顶级医院开出优厚条件留他他说科学可以没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78360,
      "end_ms": 80805,
      "text": "医生不能没有祖国回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 83400,
      "text": "一九四九年解放前夕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83820,
      "end_ms": 89965,
      "text": "傅作义将军的夫人亲自送来一张亲笔签名的飞机票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90450,
      "end_ms": 92165,
      "text": "拿着他能去任何城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92490,
      "end_ms": 94565,
      "text": "多少人用金条都换不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95300,
      "end_ms": 96395,
      "text": "他却谢绝了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 96780,
      "end_ms": 98165,
      "text": "我的病人还在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 98320,
      "end_ms": 99255,
      "text": "我哪儿也不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 100100,
      "end_ms": 101445,
      "text": "他不是不爱国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101840,
      "end_ms": 104675,
      "text": "他只是把国守在了产房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105620,
      "end_ms": 109835,
      "text": "他爱这个国家的证据是一点一点做出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 111350,
      "end_ms": 112370,
      "text": "一九零一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 112450,
      "end_ms": 114155,
      "text": "他出生在厦门鼓浪屿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114600,
      "end_ms": 116705,
      "text": "五岁丧母励志学医，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 117630,
      "end_ms": 119995,
      "text": "一九二一年考进协和医学院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 120390,
      "end_ms": 121710,
      "text": "后来成了新中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121730,
      "end_ms": 123225,
      "text": "第一位女院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 123590,
      "end_ms": 125485,
      "text": "中国妇产科学的奠基人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126220,
      "end_ms": 128015,
      "text": "他接生了五万多个婴儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128360,
      "end_ms": 132985,
      "text": "其中就有袁隆平钟南山见了他都要喊一声姑婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 133560,
      "end_ms": 134500,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 134600,
      "end_ms": 136015,
      "text": "他做的还不止这些，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136440,
      "end_ms": 140765,
      "text": "他发现光在产房里救人远远不够。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 141660,
      "end_ms": 143035,
      "text": "新中国成立前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 143590,
      "end_ms": 147020,
      "text": "我国的婴儿死亡率高达千分之二百。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 147160,
      "end_ms": 147865,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 148690,
      "end_ms": 153705,
      "text": "每出生一千个孩子有两百个活不过周岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 154530,
      "end_ms": 158275,
      "text": "多少孩子根本等不到见医生一面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 159290,
      "end_ms": 161645,
      "text": "他说过一句特别朴素的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 162560,
      "end_ms": 165295,
      "text": "医院只是治病的第二道防线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 165790,
      "end_ms": 168185,
      "text": "第一道防线是在预防上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 168660,
      "end_ms": 174705,
      "text": "于是他带着团队在北京开展大规模的妇女宫颈癌普查。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175590,
      "end_ms": 179635,
      "text": "那时候很多农村妇女一辈子没进过医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 180270,
      "end_ms": 182290,
      "text": "觉得妇科检查不光彩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 182570,
      "end_ms": 183310,
      "text": "躲着不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 183570,
      "end_ms": 185470,
      "text": "他就挨家挨户的动员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 185510,
      "end_ms": 186970,
      "text": "带着医生们上门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 187850,
      "end_ms": 190310,
      "text": "在他苦口婆心的劝解之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 191090,
      "end_ms": 193490,
      "text": "几十万名女性走进医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 194230,
      "end_ms": 196710,
      "text": "他了人生第一次妇科检查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 197650,
      "end_ms": 199230,
      "text": "他怕老百姓听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 199270,
      "end_ms": 205570,
      "text": "医学术语就主编了家庭卫生顾问、农村妇幼卫生常识问答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 206410,
      "end_ms": 213200,
      "text": "用大白话告诉最偏远的山村妇女生孩子不是闯鬼门关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 213960,
      "end_ms": 217100,
      "text": "他接生一般不开刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217520,
      "end_ms": 219500,
      "text": "而是努力矫正胎位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 219940,
      "end_ms": 220400,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 220820,
      "end_ms": 223080,
      "text": "绝不能出现医生治好了病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 223540,
      "end_ms": 226440,
      "text": "病人却失去了完整生活的情况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 226560,
      "end_ms": 229600,
      "text": "他守产房一守就是半个多世纪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 230200,
      "end_ms": 231340,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 231380,
      "end_ms": 232720,
      "text": "太平洋战争爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 233160,
      "end_ms": 234440,
      "text": "协和医院关门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 234880,
      "end_ms": 237740,
      "text": "他就在东堂子胡同开小诊所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 238520,
      "end_ms": 239925,
      "text": "穷人没钱治病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 240090,
      "end_ms": 240360,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 240600,
      "end_ms": 242385,
      "text": "还倒贴鸡蛋和红糖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242810,
      "end_ms": 243770,
      "text": "后来那些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 243970,
      "end_ms": 245165,
      "text": "他受了委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 245510,
      "end_ms": 246865,
      "text": "被伐打扫卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 247280,
      "end_ms": 247935,
      "text": "洗便盆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 248400,
      "end_ms": 249515,
      "text": "他也只说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 249990,
      "end_ms": 251590,
      "text": "只要还让我留在协和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 251930,
      "end_ms": 253005,
      "text": "干什么都行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 253620,
      "end_ms": 256085,
      "text": "一九八三年四月二十二号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 256570,
      "end_ms": 258265,
      "text": "八十二岁的他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 258760,
      "end_ms": 259665,
      "text": "弥留之际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 259930,
      "end_ms": 263580,
      "text": "他断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 263740,
      "end_ms": 266325,
      "text": "这是他留在世间的最后一句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 267280,
      "end_ms": 271595,
      "text": "林巧志生前留下遗嘱三万元积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 272120,
      "end_ms": 277825,
      "text": "全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 278360,
      "end_ms": 281315,
      "text": "骨灰撒回故乡鼓浪屿的海面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 281660,
      "end_ms": 283515,
      "text": "您看他这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 283880,
      "end_ms": 285505,
      "text": "其实就干了一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 285850,
      "end_ms": 292125,
      "text": "让中国的孩子平安的来到这个世界上开国大典那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 292660,
      "end_ms": 295025,
      "text": "他没能站在天安门城楼上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 295630,
      "end_ms": 296315,
      "text": "可今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 296770,
      "end_ms": 299350,
      "text": "每一个平安出生的中国孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 299650,
      "end_ms": 302710,
      "text": "每一个当了妈妈的中国女人都记得他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 303190,
      "end_ms": 304190,
      "text": "什么叫爱国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304650,
      "end_ms": 306110,
      "text": "爱国不是喊口号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306450,
      "end_ms": 308030,
      "text": "是把民族的未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 308210,
      "end_ms": 311550,
      "text": "一个个接到人世间民族的未来是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 311950,
      "end_ms": 313110,
      "text": "就是咱们的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 313910,
      "end_ms": 315390,
      "text": "可孩子总会长大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 315810,
      "end_ms": 317550,
      "text": "总有一天会问爷爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 317790,
      "end_ms": 319870,
      "text": "咱们中国为什么了不起？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 320670,
      "end_ms": 321550,
      "text": "到那时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 321970,
      "end_ms": 324790,
      "text": "您指着手里的国之脊梁跟他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 325810,
      "end_ms": 328040,
      "text": "因为中我出过这样一群人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 328480,
      "end_ms": 335060,
      "text": "林巧至钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等等四十位院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 335260,
      "end_ms": 336600,
      "text": "他们一辈子的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 336700,
      "end_ms": 337800,
      "text": "全在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 338220,
      "end_ms": 341100,
      "text": "中科院学不编的有老照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 341360,
      "end_ms": 342100,
      "text": "有插画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 342480,
      "end_ms": 343720,
      "text": "孩子看得进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 344240,
      "end_ms": 345580,
      "text": "大子看得心热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 346040,
      "end_ms": 352040,
      "text": "科学群星耀华夏院士精神代代传说的就是他们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 352520,
      "end_ms": 355400,
      "text": "您给孩子讲这些不是讲故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 355740,
      "end_ms": 358315,
      "text": "是给他心心里种下一颗种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 358740,
      "end_ms": 361665,
      "text": "这个国家是靠什么人撑起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 362710,
      "end_ms": 365030,
      "text": "等有一天孩子跟别人说起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 365050,
      "end_ms": 366875,
      "text": "我爷爷给我讲过林巧智，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 367470,
      "end_ms": 371445,
      "text": "您就明白了什么是真正的爱国教育。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 372340,
      "end_ms": 378140,
      "text": "这本书我不是非让我是觉得他该在攒家书架上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 378360,
      "end_ms": 379680,
      "text": "有一本不冲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 379740,
      "end_ms": 380830,
      "text": "别的就冲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 380870,
      "end_ms": 383180,
      "text": "孩子将来能挺直腰杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 383200,
      "end_ms": 383815,
      "text": "说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 384160,
      "end_ms": 387230,
      "text": "咱中国出过这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 387860,
      "end_ms": 390735,
      "text": "点亮红心收藏这条视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 391210,
      "end_ms": 393310,
      "text": "转发给家里当妈的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 393310,
      "end_ms": 398195,
      "text": "看看评论区留下一句致敬万英之母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 398530,
      "end_ms": 404155,
      "text": "让更多人记住这位把一生献给中国母亲和孩子的医生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 404780,
      "end_ms": 405425,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 405800,
      "end_ms": 407475,
      "text": "下期讲述最后一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00145",
      "start_ms": 408610,
      "end_ms": 411470,
      "text": "如果人民币上要印一位中国女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c809825a54509d6e_s00146",
      "start_ms": 411690,
      "end_ms": 413065,
      "text": "凭什么是她？"
    }
  ],
